{"id":"3ed97cf68bae6e3d529a6605024dd298df8ee7e8","url":"https://www.leiphone.com/category/ai/3vRqaeAILJdgRlhL.html","title":"姚期智杨植麟首次联手给 AI 出的博士级题目，Kimi 多画出了「关键一条边」 | 雷峰网","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":null,"excerpt":"Kimi 刷新 629 条边图论参考纪录，只多加了1条边，为什么数学界等了这么多年？","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n                                                <!-- 123 -->\n                        \n                        \n                                                \n                        <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- xhBPeYDbNuuRZkwy -->\n                                                <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- 正文内容 -->\n                        <section data-mpa-action-id=\"mmiwq6ij1i3r\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"姚期智杨植麟首次联手给 AI 出的博士级题目，Kimi 多画出了「关键一条边」\" data-src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261112/6af581d8f0d3a.jpg\" data-ratio=\"0.55\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1000\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/XqAicMdcoiafNM7VhBibf0u4f309FOm8zPaG9pbH1iaia9nhZ5ZrTSQwANnrZwHgXfyBUrsIibBMxQjMkS7kLIYmn6B1YGxlZ8DKmqISmmBFrqHpQ/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"546\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"307\" data-imgfileid=\"100265080\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261112/6af581d8f0d3a.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"5 10 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix4tgk1t7p\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-data-temp-type=\"image\" mpa-data-temp-power-by=\"yiban.io\" data-mpa-template=\"t\" data-mid=\"\"><section><section><span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix6wyl1l05\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Kimi 刷新 629 条边图论参考纪录，只多加了1条边，为什么数学界等了这么多年？</span></span></span></span></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mqgbkegzw9n\"></span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mpmlbwxl8oz\"></span><span data-lark-reco